    "learnerTask": "Trace receptor instructions into T cells and source protein into peptide–HLA on tumor",
    "gap": "Converging flow omits receptor/CD3 assembly and compartment boundaries",
    "accuracyGuardrails": "No receptor entry into tumor; exact peptide–HLA; natural processing and safety independent",
