    "reasoning": "The instruction arrow ends in the T cell, while the source protein and processing/loading remain inside the separate tumor compartment. A paired TCR and adjacent schematic CD3 meet an exact peptide-HLA address across two membranes; the receptor never enters the tumor. The retained three-format comparison supplies product context, while this extension supplies the living-cell contact and compartment boundary missing from the frozen task. The footer and caption keep natural presentation, recognition, killing and safety independent. The drawing is a simplified relationship map, not atomic stoichiometry or a construct recipe."
